<title>MOROCCO: Morocco, Algeria start fasting month of Ramadan.</title>
<headline>Morocco, Algeria start fasting month of Ramadan.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco and Algeria started the Moslem holy fasting month of Ramadan on Friday.</p>
<p>The official Moroccan news agency MAP said late on Thursday that the new moon had been sighted and Ramadan would start on Friday.</p>
<p>Algeria's official news agency APS made a similar announcement.</p>
</text>
